 <div class="container-wide">
 <h2 class="section-title text-center">Comment Fonctionnent les Batteries Chauffantes</h2>
 <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">Les batteries chauffantes fournissent une tension DC constante aux éléments chauffants résistifs intégrés dans le tissu des vêtements. Contrairement aux batteries externes USB standard, elles sont optimisées pour une décharge soutenue à courant élevé par basses températures.</p>

 <blockquote class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 bg-brandOrange/5 border-l-4 border-brandOrange rounded-r-xl px-6 py-5 text-sm text-slate-700 italic leading-relaxed">
  <p>"The global heated clothing market is projected to grow from $480 million in 2025 to $830 million by 2031 at a 9.56% CAGR, while the battery-heated warm jacket segment specifically is forecast to reach $451 million by 2031 at a 12% CAGR. The U.S. ski industry alone recorded 60.4 million visits in the 2023-2024 season, with winter sports participation exceeding 30 million participants. The key differentiator for brands is the battery: runtime at sub-zéro températures, connector reliability over 500+ charge cycles, and multi-market safety certifications — PSE (Japan), UL (US), UN38.3 (global air transport), and CE (EU) — are what separate premium heated apparel from commodity imports."</p>
  <cite class="block text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2 not-italic">— <a href="https://www.techsciresearch.com/report/heated-clothing-market/14740.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline">TechSci Research</a>, Heated Clothing Market 2026-2031; <a href="https://qyang.livedoor.blog/archives/10959428.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline">QY Research</a>, Battery Heated Warm Jackets Market 2025-2031</cite>
 </blockquote>

 <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
